    <title>关于更换QSL卡邮寄地址标记方式的通告</title>
    <link href="/2024/12/28/%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2QSL%E5%8D%A1%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A/"/>
    <url>/2024/12/28/%E5%85%B3%E4%BA%8E%E6%9B%B4%E6%8D%A2QSL%E5%8D%A1%E9%82%AE%E5%AF%84%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E7%9A%84%E9%80%9A%E5%91%8A/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="BG5EEJ-通告"><a href="#BG5EEJ-通告" class="headerlink" title="BG5EEJ 通告"></a>BG5EEJ 通告</h1><p>​即日起（2024.12.28） 本台qsl卡信封地址的打印方式均由手写改为热敏纸打印，敬请各位要换卡的友台及时保存地址，以免地址信息一段时间后消失 <br>​若有手写地址需要 请在换卡时说明，本台仍然提供手写地址的信封！<br>​<br>​</p><h1 id="​BG5EEJ通告​"><a href="#​BG5EEJ通告​" class="headerlink" title="​BG5EEJ通告​"></a>​BG5EEJ通告​</h1><p>即日起（2024.12.28）本臺qsl卡信封地址的列印管道均由手寫改為熱敏紙列印，敬請各位要換卡的友臺及時保存地址，以免地址資訊一段時間後消失​ <br>若有手寫地址需要請在換卡時說明，本臺仍然提供手寫地址的信封！<br>​</p><h1 id="​BG5EEJ-Notice"><a href="#​BG5EEJ-Notice" class="headerlink" title="​BG5EEJ Notice"></a>​BG5EEJ Notice</h1><p>Starting from today (December 28, 2024), the printing method for QSL card envelope addresses on this platform will be changed from handwritten to thermal paper printing. We kindly ask all friends who want to change cards to save their addresses in a timely manner to avoid the address information disappearing after a period of time <br>If there is a handwritten address required, please explain it when changing the card. Our station still provides envelopes with handwritten addresses! </p>]]></content>
    
    
